  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Mosimann — born in Switzerland and previously known as Quentin Mosimann — has reaffirmed his position in the Top 100 DJs after a seven-year hiatus. This year he’s been on an upward trajectory with his well-documented Dream Tour dates at Zenith in Paris, where he got to shine with his unique live performances, playing drums, keyboards and singing. In January his re-rub of the ’90s Belgian classic ‘Drop That Beat’ by Ixxel sparked an energy that rippled through the rumours of a new album release, and a clutch of singles played out in real time at headline appearances across the globe.",
